# RESEARCH PAPER AUDIT — RP-* status, NORTHSTAR alignment, claim drift

File: openOODA/audit/research_paper_audit.oot
Date: 2026-08-19. Source: `openOODA.github.io/research/RP-*.oot` (49 papers) + `CONFLICTS.oot`.
Method: Read H1 + first paragraph of each paper. Compare title to NORTHSTAR leaf and to current SHIPPED/ROADMAP status. Did not read full body.

## 1. Top-line

All 49 RP-* papers are `draft` per `research/README.oot` line 22. The archive is filled but not human-reviewed. CONFLICTS.oot is the only file that has been promoted into a working synthesis. This audit does not change paper status; it just maps headers to truth.

